docs {
  Fetch the dynamic fields owned by a parent object's UID.

  **Service:** `sui.rpc.v2.StateService` · **Method:** `ListDynamicFields` (unary)

  **Request fields:**
  - `parent` (required string): the UID of the parent object.
  - `page_size` (optional uint32): max entries to return. Default 50, max 1000.
  - `page_token` (optional bytes): pass `next_page_token` to paginate.
  - `read_mask` (optional FieldMask): defaults to `parent,field_id`.

  Example uses `0x5` (`SuiSystemState`), which has at least one dynamic
  field on mainnet.

  Verified against `sui-mainnet.g.alchemy.com`.
}
